# Code with `<b>x</b>` in a heading

HTML specials in code are shown, never parsed: `</>`, `<b>x</b>`, `a && b`,
`x < y`, `"quoted"`, and `<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>` stays text.

| case | code |
|---|---|
| tags | `<b>x</b>` |
| operators | `a && b`, `x < y` |

```html
<b>x</b> & "q" < y
```

```
<b>x</b> & "q" < y
```

```nosuchlang
<b>x</b> & "q" < y
```
